We managed to slow the flow of the glacial river and the drop in temperature, but we are still out of time. It is the energy of the Snow Lady and the Snowstorm Dragon that feeds the rivers' sources. We have no choice but to get past the Snow Tribe and defeat the Snow Lady and the Snowstorm Dragon in their own domains.

We have to hurry, or we will enter a new Ice Age.

Quick, let us go to Commander Derik. He must have a plan to strike back at the Snow Tribe and defeat the Snow Lady and the mighty Snowstorm Dragon.

